      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "死将の塚は、亡者共が跋扈する不浄な土地だ。\nその場所に、最近、異形の化け物が出没するという。\n調査に神殿兵を向かわせたが、いずれも行方不明だ。\n礼ははずむ。原因の調査と排除をしてくれないか？",
        "official_en": "Fallen General's Barrows is an unholy land. Temple\nsoldiers sent to investigate monster sightings never\nreturned. Look into it, and eliminate any trouble you\nfind. You'll be well compensated for the effort.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
