      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ドラゴンゾンビ？\nそれが異形の正体か……不浄ここに極まれりだな。\nいや、あの場所を放置していた我々にも責任がある。\n苦労をかけたな。報酬を受け取ってくれ。",
        "official_en": "Necrodragon? It's stunning that the land could\nbecome so tainted. I'll find a priest to cleanse\nthe area and we can return to resettle. Thank\nyou for the help. Here's your reward.",
        "real_en": "Zombie Dragon? It's stunning that the land could\nbecome so tainted. I'll find a priest to cleanse\nthe area and we can return to resettle. Thank\nyou for the help. Here's your reward."
      },
